<title>JAPAN: Kobe Steel cuts 96/97 group current prft forecast.</title>
<headline>Kobe Steel cuts 96/97 group current prft forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd said on Wednesday that it had lowered its forecast for group current profit in the year to March 31, 1997, to 45 billion yen from its previous forecast of 55 billion yen.</p>
</text>
